  "body": "The #2435 wall-law refusal in `crates/motion/src/machining2d/chamfer_ride.rs` (`ride_loops`) says \"would ride into the part\". It says this also when the chamfer source is the stock and no part is near. #2483 found this with a tilted stock-source chamfer.\n\nDone means: the refusal text names the stock when the source is the stock, or uses a word that fits the two cases. A test pins the text.",
